window.products.push({"id":249502,"name":"Onebttl 50th Birthday Wine Tumbler For Women, Female, Her - Cheers To 50 Years -12oz Stainless Steel Insulated Wine Tumbler with Lid, Message Card - (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L9EDFbAFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE 50TH YEARS BIRTHDAY GIFT FOR HER - Beautifully packaged and gift-ready, this 50th birthday stainless steel wine tumbler makes the perfect novelty gift! The commemorative gift experience for your best friend, sister, daughter, niece, girlfriend, wife or coworker. BEAUTIFUL ORIGINAL ONEBTTL DESIGN - This unique stainless steel wine tumbler is designed with unique patterns and fits perfectly in hand. A generous 12 oz tumbler is for any kind of wine or drinks. The clear, press-in lid has a small opening to allow you to sip on-the-go or use a straw in the packaging. HIGH QUALITY - This tumbler is made from 304 18/8 food-grade double-wall vacuum insulated stainless steel, it'll keep drinks icy cold or piping hot! Perfect for wine, beer, cocktails, coffee and ice cream sundae! PREMIUM SPLASHPROOF LID - The BPA Free splash resistant lid can keep her from spilling or making messes when she is drinking coffee or wine in the backyard if she is moving around or putting her bottle with coffee or wine on her car. YOUR 100% SATISFACTION IS THE FIRST PRIORITY - We want your friends, girlfriend, coworker, and relatives to absolutely love this unique and novelty tumbler. If for some reason they don't love it, please contact us and we will issue a prompt replacement or full refund!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L9EDFbAFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onebttl","source_asin":"B07XJYB6LP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XJYB6LP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XJYB6LP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
