window.products.push({"id":249550,"name":"Accessories for Shark IQ Vacuum Replacement for Shark Robot R101AE (RV1001AE), R101 (RV1001) - 4 Hepa Filters, 6 Side Brushes, 2 Filter, 4 Base Pre-Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g8n322DoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅[PERFECT REPLACEMENT PART] - Shark Robot Vacuum Replacement are made of quality material, H13 High-Efficiency Durable Inlet air filter with 660 PPT density and Extra-thick Base Pre-Motor Foam & Anti-static felt filter with textured surface can capture food scraps, hair, dirt etc. Durable side brushes reach into corners and edges to remove more dirt and debris. Air outlet high efficiency filter can capture 99.97% of dust and prevent them from being released directly back into the air stream ✅[COMPATIBLE MODEL]- Shark Vacuum Replacement parts are compatible Shark IQ AV1002AE, AV1010AE, AV1110ARUS T3, R101, R101AE, RV1001, RV1100SR, RV1000AE, RV1001AE, RV2502AE, RV1000S, UR1000SR Series etc. If you are not sure whether Shark Replacement parts are fit for your machine, please feel free to contact us ✅[VALUE PACK] - The package is a complete Shark Robot Vacuum parts, including 2 x Air outlet high efficiency filter, 6 x Side Brushes, 4 x Inlet air efficient filtration filter, 4 x 3.7\" High Base Pre-Motor Foam & Anti-static felt filters Kit and 1 extra cleaning brush. You’d better clean the filter frequently to ensure your vacuums working at a high level and extend service life. If you use your Shark Robot Vacuum a lot, we recommend this great value set ✅[ABOUT CLEANING] - If the bristles of the side brush to bend, you only need to soak the side brush in hot water for a few minutes to restore. The extra cleaning brush has a little razor on it for slicing hair off the spinner. We recommend try not to wash the HEPA filter. Washing is likely to make fiber deformation and dust blocked mesh. The Foam Filters can be washed and reused. Note: Make sure they are dry before re-installing ✅[120 DAYS WARRRANTY]- During the warranty period, if the Shark Vacuum parts has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customers’ satisfaction are our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g8n322DoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B09W27WG6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W27WG6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W27WG6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
