window.products.push({"id":249580,"name":"Lifeasy Retro Classic Steam Train Shower Curtain Fabric Kids Bathroom Decor Sets with Hooks Waterproof 72 x 72 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlo-VXvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Family Safe and Healthy with 100% Polyester Shower Curtain. Product Information Measurements: 72” Width x 72” Height inches, Includes 1 shower curtain and 12 Plastic Hooks. Product Description: Hotel quality cloth, Washable, Ecofriendly. Easy to Clean and Maintain: Machine washable, Wash cold by gentle cycle, Mild detergent needs to be used, Do not bleach. Quick drying: low temperature Ironing. Guarantee to Keep You Safe: We recommend fully opening your shower curtain to dry after each use. You can find a theme for everybody and every interest in our Amazon Collection. Our unique &modern designs, Makeover your bathroom, toilet, restroom, kitchen, master bathroom, kids bathroom, window, guest suite or hotel bath with just a single touch! Includes curtains, carpets, bathroom mats and other bathroom accessories. Our shower curtains are beautiful and creative, can be given to moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmothers, grandfathers, wives, husbands, sons, daughters. Either a gift to your family or friend, parents, grandparents, relative, boyfriend, girlfriend, or to yourself, the item should be interesting and authentic. Men, women, kids, teens, boys or girls will love this item. Product sizes that measured by hand lead to the difference between about 1-2 Inch due to everyone’s measurement technique. All the products in the store are all real shooting, but because the light shooting and display the type, and personal understanding of color is different, there may be a little deviation. Hope will understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlo-VXvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifeasy","source_asin":"B0BZV3QHGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZV3QHGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZV3QHGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249581,"name":"Tea Kettles, 2.7 Quart Teapots for Stove Top Whistling, Wooden Insulated Handle and Food Grade Stainless Steel Tea Pot for Tea, Coffee, Milk(Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ho6j1sDQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉Large Capacity &Safe to Use- Our Blue Sea Kettle is made of stainless steel and has a large capacity to make tea for your whole family in this large 2.7 qt pitcher. Every surface that comes into contact with water and food particles is certified food-grade safe, so you can use it with confidence. 👉 Loud Whistle - Loud automatic whistle can grab your attention even in noisy environments. When you focus on housework, movies, music or any other things, the teapot will whistle to remind you after boiling water, effectively reducing safety hazards and preventing boiling. NOTE: Do not overfill the jug or the whistle may not work. 👉Heat-Proof Handle with Easy-Touch Button - This gradient blue teapot, silicone coated insulated handle effectively insulates from heat, and the ergonomically shaped and designed handle increases pouring and filling comfort. The button setting allows you to easily open or close the spout without worrying about easy leakage. 👉Suitable for Various Stovetops: It is compatible with all types of stoves. During use, it is not recommended to use high fire, because high fire will overheat the pot body and even cause the paint to fall off. After the water is boiled, you can wait for a while and use it after the steam dissipates, so as not to burn your hands. 🌟After-sale Guarantee:Our product enjoys a 12-months warranty, you can buy it with confidence. If you encounter any problem, please contact us, we will definitely help you solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ho6j1sDQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hauce Radio","source_asin":"B0C4LHPCNT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4LHPCNT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4LHPCNT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
