window.products.push({"id":249644,"name":"NaturalAreaRugs Sevilla Collection Jute Area Rug, Handmade, 100% Jute, Anti-Static, Durable, Elegant, Soft, Stain Resistant, Eco/Environment-Friendly,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G8Uhwe98L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Natural Area Rugs Sevilla Jute Rug: Keep your floors clean and inviting with spectacular fusion of fashion- forward pattern, color, and textured Jute by Natural Area Rugs. It breathes a layer of clean, organic texture which brings a dash of breezy style to any space whether it's a living room, bedroom, or office. It has a versatile solid pattern that dexterously blends with most of the room settings. Its loop construction adds visual and textural dimension. A minimalistic pattern with a simple color scheme makes this rug a timeless and calming accent. Made from natural Jute and dyed in neutral tones, each of these rugs is made by skilled weavers who employ a variety of traditional techniques to create these simply beautiful styles. Its fibers exhibit naturally anti-static, insulating and moisture regulating properties. The fibers infuse classic settings with simple beauty and a breath of fresh style. Natural Area Rugs recommend a Carpet/Rug Pad as it will protect not only your rug but your hardwood floor as well. You can vacuum it regularly to keep dirt from getting trapped in the fibers. Avoid direct sunlight to prevent fading. Product Details: Product Type: Area Rug Construction/Technique: Hand-Made Material: 100% Jute Style: Contemporary Backing: Anti-Static Rug Pad: Recommended (Sold Separately) Country of Manufacturer: Imported Crafted by: Artisan Rug Makers Number of Item included: 1 Dimensions and Weight: Size: (6 Feet x 9 Feet) Length x Width x Height: (72 L x 108 W x 0.5 H) Product Weight: 35 Pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G8Uhwe98L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Area Rugs","source_asin":"B00K38QAGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K38QAGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K38QAGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249645,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Best Electric Can Opener, Kitchen Can Opener Electric, Restaurant Can Opener Electric Can/Tin Opener, Automatic by Cooks Professi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d8WQTpvML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 15) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d8WQTpvML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALYWOOD","source_asin":"B0851D7VGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0851D7VGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0851D7VGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
