window.products.push({"id":249669,"name":"DORBOKER 12\" Original Moving Gears Wall Clock, Large Industrial Wall Clock for Living Room Decor, Retro Metal Solid Wood Vintage Farmhouse Steampunk R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xei+qzHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧭【Unique Design, Only For Your Home】 Round solid Wood frame and classic retro metal skeleton with real mechanical moving gears in the central, the wooden frame is handcraft, showing unique attractive wood grain color and small natural knots; fake rust treatment marks on the metal skeleton for vintage and industrial effect; stronger tempered glass resists any breakage and keeps safety whenever; The design is very different from other clocks, just to break the ordinary, only for your home. 🧭【Real Moving Gears Wall Clock】The large rustic wall clock is design with multi-real moving gears, put battery in, various gears start working, makes a subtle relaxing sound and makes a living element in the environment in where it is placed, vintage and magical, catch all eyes of visits. 🧭【Oversized clock and Silent Movement】 This giant farmhouse wall clock measures 12\" (30CM) in diameter, 2.9'' (7.5CM) in depth, weight-12.56lbs (0.7kg), extra large size and heavy duty. Using high quality quartz movement material to run smoothly, ensuring accurate timing and absolute silence. Big Roman Numerals, HT toughened glass cover, you can easily read the time from any angle. 🧭【Perfect Home Decoration, Great Gift】 Whether moving into a new home or looking for a special Gift for friend or familier, this oversized wall clock is a good choice, fits most décor whether country, rustic or modern farmhouse, vintage retro, shabby chic; Suitable for kitchen, dining, living room, foyer, hallway, anyroom. Also for bar, restaurant, coffee house, office, commercial, studio, anywhere. 🧭【Battery Operated, Easy to Install】 The extra large wall clock arrives fully assembled, Powered by 3 x AA battery ( not included ): 2 batteries for the gears to start spinning,1 battery for the clock hands to move to tell the time; Gears move independently of hands. With a hanging hole on its back and including the hanger for easy to installation. 🧭【Our Promise to You 】 We are confident in the quality of our large moving gears clocks, DORBOKER provides FULL REFUND/REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE. If there are any issue about our gears wall clock, please feel free to contact us anytime, we will reply to you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xei+qzHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DORBOKER","source_asin":"B08Q3HW8RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q3HW8RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q3HW8RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
