window.products.push({"id":249681,"name":"London England Skyline IX by Michael Tompsett, 12 by 19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819T98c1lML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful skyline of London, England. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. ; Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819T98c1lML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00KGP94YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KGP94YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KGP94YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249682,"name":"Crafthouse by Fortessa Professional Barware/Bar Tools by Charles Joly, 4.25\" Stainless Steel and Black Walnut Channel Knife/Cocktail Fruit Garnish Pee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDXDRr22L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crafthouse by Fortessa is a comprehensive barware collection for the aspiring home mixologist, designed by World Champion bartender, Charles Joly. Charles has applied his bartending ethos to the broad line of tools and glassware to bring the authentic cocktail experience home. Inspired by prohibition-era barware and updated with contemporary ergonomic principles, Crafthouse by Fortessa provides all the tools to create professional grade cocktails at home. Each piece is designed from the golden age of cocktails and the streamlined simplicity of Deco architecture. Charles Joly is a James Beard Award winner and a lifelong food and beverage professional. The Chicago-native is a certified mixologist who focuses on a balance between the classics and his own seasonal original cocktails. With a strong emphasis on knowing the roots of the craft along with a progressive vision for the future every feature is purposeful and every detail functional. Entertain like a world class bartender with Crafthouse by Fortessa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDXDRr22L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crafthouse by Fortessa","source_asin":"B077GWG3LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GWG3LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GWG3LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249683,"name":"Alishomtll Sunflower Beach Towel, Yellow Sunshine Beach Towel, Super Soft Beach Towel Sand Free Quick Dry Beach Towels, 31.5 x 59 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmojcOwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNER SAY: Our quick dry beach towel is specially printed with popular sunflower elements. Composed of popular, sunflower blossom in vibrant colors, this microfiber beach towel will offer a fresh feeling to you weather you are relaxing at the beach, pool, traveling or camping. Smurfs Yingda -- Make Everyday Living Easier: As a comprehensive home textile company, Smurfs Yingda strives to help people organize and enhance their home with high quality & lower price products! Reliable Material: Made of high quality microfiber terry cloth material, this beach towel is super soft, light weight and durable enough.It will offer exceptional absorbency and sand free. Unique Design: Adopt popular colorful sunflower pattern, the popular and fresh pattern will bring a fun and new feeling. It also makes a perfect gift idea. Water Absorbent & Quick-dry: The quick dry beach towel will soak up water quickly when drying off, they also will remain soft and durable after washing. Sand Free: This beach towel is super convenient to keep sand away, Simply shake the beach towel and the sand off.  It will prevent you from sand when you’re tanning at the beach, pool or camping. Standard Size: Our beach towel size : 31.5 x 58.3 inches.(2ft x 4.8ft ). Appropriate for most people to cover or wrapped up after swimming.It is easy to fit in your luggage or backpacks after folding. Package Included: 1 x Sand Free Beach Towel Warm Notice: -1-2cm/0.4”-0.8” is allowed due to manual measurement. CLICK THE YELLOW 'ADD TO CART' BUTTON ABOVE to send it to your family, friends, guests. It absolutely will become the best gift what they receive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmojcOwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alishomtll","source_asin":"B083B9W7WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083B9W7WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083B9W7WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
