window.products.push({"id":249744,"name":"Sweese 523.204 6 Inch Round Cake Pan, Non-stick Baking Pan, Set of 2, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YvskUjCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE & FUNCTIONAL - Sweese’s 6-Inch round cake pan set is not only good for baking cake, pizza, pie but also good baking dishes to bake anything from sharing gratin, roasted meat, lasagna, casseroles, brownies, desserts, and more. The uses of this pan set are endless! COOKS EVENLY & EASY-RELEASE - Sweese’s ceramic construction offers even heating and superior heat retention. Non-stick glazed surfaces make release easier. PRO-GRADE PORCELAIN & SAFE FOR DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE, OVEN, AND FREEZER - Sweese Cake Baking Pans is made of durable porcelain, a type of premium LEAD-FREE ceramic, chip-resistant and more sturdy than stoneware. Never worry about harmful toxins leaching into your food. Safe to use around your family. Can go directly from freezer or refrigerator to a hot oven, to table. ELEGANT GREAT LOOKING FOR ALL OCCASIONS - With an elegant and stylish design, these ceramic cake pans go anywhere and look fantastic in any setting. Impress your guests and simply add a touch of sophistication to any table. The beautiful colors make it easy to mix and match with other Sweese dishes. And the handle on the sides gives it an interesting look and easy oven-to-table transport. EASY TO CLEAN - Whether you want to clean them by hand or with your dishwasher, it won't matter because the smooth porcelain texture makes cleanup a breeze. The heavy-duty, glazed porcelain moves easily from oven to microwave to freezer without a hitch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YvskUjCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B08CZVYH54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZVYH54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZVYH54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249745,"name":"SONIVE Waterproof Mattress Pad Ultra Fluffy Soft Breathable Noiseless Quilted Fitted Mattress Protector Premuim Alternative Filling Topper Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xiU48GvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF: Twin mattress pad (60x80x15\") with a premium quality impermeable TPU backing keeps your pricy mattress from dead skin cells, sweat, moisture and stain. It also protects your mattress from accidental fluid spilling and bedwetting—no worry about urine and other bodily fluids. Enjoy your deep sleep and have fun with your babies, kids, and pets in your bed. Great for new mothers, babies & toddlers, pet los and the elderly. This pad will keep your mattress neat all night. SUPPORTIVE & COMFORTABLE: A 120gsm double brushed Microfiber with an embossed process brings a special soothing touch. 5D-Mix down alternative filling maintains excellent fluffy and supportive performance. Hollow curled soft fibers offer good breathability and make it easy to keep a cooling & comfortable sleep throughout the night. A 4-layer design mattress pad with thick filling reduces the unwanted noise and movement and offers a peaceful and relaxing sleeping environment for you. DEEP POCKET & EASY-REMOVING: Our pad well fits most thick mattresses. The 360° all-around covering skirt stretches up to 21\". The 1.5\" elastic band adds a \"double security\" to help the pad hold your mattress tightly. You can turn as you like during sleep and do not worry about slipping away. It is ideal for all seasons of bedrooms, kids' rooms, guest rooms, and vacation houses. A great gift idea for kids, the elderly, men and women, moms and dads, Valentine's, Mother's Day, and Father's Day. DURABLE & EASY CARE: This pad is shrinkage-free and wrinkle-resistant. It is made of durable fiber that withstands tearing after multiple washes. Machine wash in cold water (up to 45℃). Tumble under a gentle cycle and natural drying to make it fluffy again. Please do not bleach, iron or dry clean. TIPS: This Pad is packaged in a vacuum bag. Please spread it for a few hours before your first use to make it fluffy again. No ironing or steam-ironing could make the embossed surface long-lasting. SATISFACTION & PROMISE: We create a cozier home for you with our 50 years of experience in textiles. All products are certified with OEKO-Tex Standard 100. We would like to hear your voice at any time. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or needs. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xiU48GvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonive","source_asin":"B09Y1M4N4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1M4N4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1M4N4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
