window.products.push({"id":249766,"name":"Mesophilic Culture MM100, 3 Tablespoons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UCXYtpNrL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is the mesophilic culture to use for a more pronounced butter like flavor and a somewhat more open texture For use in soft ripened, and fresh cheeses such as: Chevre, Cream Cheese, Brie, Camembert, Gouda, Edam, Blue, Feta, and Havarti. This culture contains the 2 primary cultures of MA011 but the diacetylactis will produce CO2 and a butter like flavor/aroma. Cheese made with this culture will be somewhat more open in texture and in a cheese such as gouda will provide the desired, small round holes. Contains: (LL) Lactococcus lactis subsp. lactis (LLC) Lactococcus lactis subsp. cremoris (LLD) Lactococcus lactis subsp. lactis biovar diacetylactis WHAT IS DCU? A DCU is a proprietary measurement which is neither a weight nor a volume. Instead, it is a measure of the bacterial activity contained within the entire packet, since creameries and commercial cheese makers use these packets in their entirety. A 50-DCU packet of a given lot today could weigh, for example, 14 grams, but tomorrow's lot with the same DCU value could weigh 17 grams. The entire packet as a whole will have a consistent total amount of activity. Home cheese makers only use a very small portion of the packet at one time and must slightly over-inoculate anyway; therefore, this DCU measurement and its subtle variability between won't affect your homemade cheese.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UCXYtpNrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Choozit Cultures","source_asin":"B01K8V8G3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K8V8G3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K8V8G3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":249767,"name":"FILMCELLS Trend Setters – IT – Pennywise the Dancing Clown and the Losers Club 7” x 5” MiniCell Desktop Presentation – Featuring 35 mm Film Clip with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qpZQ5GqEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Losers Club is united in this minicell from IT. Meanwhile, Pennywise holds the string to his signature red balloon, looking for his next victim. This minicell is perfect for any horror fan looking for a collector’s item to display. Commemorate the horror and cinematography with an officially licensed FilmCells presentation, featuring a real clip of 35mm film from the movie!  Included is a high-quality image framed with an easel back. Clear acrylic backing allows light to flow through and illuminate the authentic clip of 35mm film from the movie! FilmCells Presentations Each officially licensed FilmCells Presentation is carefully made with a high attention to perfection and detail. Presentations are double-matted, placed in a quality frame, and contain a clear front and back that allows natural light to enhance the film frames. Each piece of film is hand-cut from reels to provide you with the best possible scenes. The film strip portrayed in the image above is only an example of the film cells you may receive as each presentation is cut and compiled from film reels by hand. Individual cell cuts may vary from piece to piece.  These features add up to a unique and exceptional collectible that looks great in any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qpZQ5GqEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FILMCELLS","source_asin":"B088C571NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088C571NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088C571NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
