window.products.push({"id":249866,"name":"Wildkin Kids Wooden Bench Seat with Storage for Boys and Girls, Toy Box Bench Seat Features Safety Hinge, Backrest, and Two Carrying Handles, Measures","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TDq0ZCl4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Discover Wildkin's Unique Collections Wildkin is a privately owned business located in Nashville Tennessee. We offer fantastic backpacks, lunch boxes, sleeping bags, bedding and more for all ages! Your kids will love our designs and you'll love our quality and pricing! We make useful fun safe gear for kids of all ages and our colorful bags and other items are designed to be both super-safe and very useful We offer excellent quality non-toxic products With our coordinating accessories you can mix and match our high-quality and unique boys comforter sets girls comforter sets kids sheet sets kids pillows Coordinating to our kids bedding are clocks lamps and rugs Not only does Wildkin offer the finest in fun kids bedding but also a full line of kids gear including sleeping bags backpacks and lunch bags Wildkin bedding gear and room decor offer the best in quality at a reasonable priceWildkin Kids Wooden Bench Seat with Storage is the perfect playroom addition for your little one! Measuring 32 x 15.5 x 28 inches, sitting to relax with a bench seat for kids will be a lot of fun with the classic colors, always in style kids chair. The perfect accent for any decor that you shouldn’t miss in your little one’s playroom. Vivid primary colors create this eclectic transportation scene. Extra storage for all of your little one's treasures. Slow-closing metal safety hinge located beneath the seat. Coordinates with other olive kids furniture, bedding and décor. Assembly required. Product Care Instructions Wildkin’s Wildkin Kids bench with storage wood are designed specifically for big kids, little kids, and toddlers. With proper care, our Wildkin bench with storage for kids will last a long time. To clean the toy box bench for boys and girls, you can maintain sparkling design by cleaning it every week. You can best accomplish this by just using a cloth and soapy water. Wash the toy box bench for kids carefully then rinse off all the soap before letting the bench dry completely. 90 Days Warranty Against Defects We aim for a happy customer experience! All of our products feature a 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TDq0ZCl4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B01C05IEMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-249866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C05IEMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C05IEMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
